name":"cuijie","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cuijie25"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167357245,"discussion_id":"ac6298a19791233f8b7612307713fc119a910a22","body":"## 问题/功能描述\n\n修复双三次上采样（带抗锯齿）梯度计算算子中，用于计算插值核影响范围的队列大小逻辑。原计算方式在特定输入输出尺寸比例下，可能因整数除法截断导致队列大小不足，从而遗漏边界数据，影响后续插值权重计算的正确性和梯度结果的精度。\n\n## 修改方案描述\n\n修改 `getQueueSize` 函数，在计算出宽度和高度方向的队列大小（`queueSizeW` 和 `queueSizeH`）后，分别执行加一操作。此修改确保了队列容量能完全覆盖所有必要的索引，解决了因计算截断导致的边界问题，从而保证了双三次插值权重计算的完备性与梯度计算的准确性。","created_at":"2026-04-03T14:28:15+08:00","updated_at":"2026-04-03T14:28:15+08:00","user":{"id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","login":"cann-robot","object_id":"673c1552584fe8295cfd4a13","name":"CANN-robot","avatar_url":"https://cdn-img.gitcode.com/bf/ad/b7f29486a040d7b2f52bf6c78414692d7d585eb1ec628cea3eb01c9d63f68618.png?time=1755691472703","html_url":"https://gitcode.com/cann-robot"},"comment_type":"pr_comment"},{"id":167357350,"discussion_id":"33239a93857035d0d55be6710d69e9199c995726","body":"流水线任务触发成功\n任务链接 [<b><a href='https://www.openlibing.com/apps/pipelineDetail?pipelineId=4bb7a3d7db9b4fb4999330a749c3c543&pipelineRunId=e272f17985b247d8b6ab2e22691ae53a&projectName=CANN'>e272f17985b247d8b6ab2e22691ae53a</a></b>][<b><a href='https://gitcode.com/cann/infrastructure/blob/main/docs/ci/ci_guide.md'>流水线指导</a></b>]\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse\"><tr><th>任务名称</th><th>状态</th><th>日志</th><th>下载链接</th></tr>\n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>codecheck</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps/entryCheckDashCode/MR_5ec2e7ae03fb44a5bd3ac4d9e00a3520/161c5a8ef063432c26c4179cee53caf1?projectId=300033&codeHostingPlatformFlag=gitcode>>>>>></a></td>\n                        <td><a href=></a></td>\n                    </tr> \n                    <tr>\n                        <td><strong>SCA</strong></td>\n                        <td>✅ SUCCESS</td>\n                        <td><a href=https://www.openlibing.com/apps